@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

# Rider or Driver Access Token (the person asking for help)
@userToken = PASTE_USER_TOKEN_HERE

# Admin Access Token (support: read for the desk, update to act, create/delete for categories)
@adminToken = PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### Categories I can open a ticket under
GET {{baseUrl}}/support/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Open a ticket: JSON, text only (pick categoryId from the list above)
# @name openTicket
POST {{baseUrl}}/support/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "PASTE_CATEGORY_ID_HERE",
  "subject": "Charged twice for one trip",
  "message": "I was charged GHS 25 twice for this morning's trip."
}

@ticketId = {{openTicket.response.body.data.id}}

### Open a ticket with files (multipart: repeat attachments once per file, up to 5)
POST {{baseUrl}}/support/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=nframa

--nframa
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="categoryId"

PASTE_CATEGORY_ID_HERE
--nframa
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="subject"

Screenshot of the double charge
--nframa
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="attachments"; filename="charge.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./sample.png
--nframa--

### My tickets (repeat status for several)
GET {{baseUrl}}/support/tickets?status=open&status=inProgress&status=awaitingUser
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### One of my tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/support/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Mark it resolved
POST {{baseUrl}}/support/tickets/{{ticketId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Rate the help (once resolved)
POST {{baseUrl}}/support/tickets/{{ticketId}}/rate
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Sorted out quickly, thanks."
}

### Every category, with ticket counts (support: read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/support/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create a category (support: create)
# @name createCategory
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/support/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Promotions",
  "description": "Questions about promo codes and offers.",
  "audience": "rider",
  "defaultPriority": "low",
  "sortOrder": 95
}

@categoryId = {{createCategory.response.body.data.id}}

### Deactivate it (support: update)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/support/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Delete it: only while no ticket uses it (support: delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/support/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
